    "title": "Patriot Federal Credit Union Introduces Community Engagement Specialist Evana Giannini - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By News Desk ,\n14 hours ago Patriot Federal Credit Union has introduced Evana Giannini as its Community Engagement Specialist. In this role, Giannini is responsible for building connections between the credit union and the community. Her duties include coordinating Patriot Federal Credit Union’s events and sponsorships and helping connect community members with resources and programs that support engagement and relationship building. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
